														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4521433">
									

<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JUrfrCfvZDc">All dressed up and nowhere to go,</a></em><br />
<em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JUrfrCfvZDc">Walking the streets all alone.</a></em><br />
<em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JUrfrCfvZDc">Another night you wish you could forget,</a></em><br />
<em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JUrfrCfvZDc">Making yourself up as you go along.</a></em></p>
<p><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JUrfrCfvZDc">Who's gonna take you home tonight?</a></em><br />
<em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JUrfrCfvZDc">Who's gonna take you home?</a></em><br />
<em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JUrfrCfvZDc">Who's gonna take you home tonight?</a></em><br />
<em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JUrfrCfvZDc">Who's gonna take you home?</a></em></p>
<p><em><strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JUrfrCfvZDc">Does god bless your transsexual heart</a></strong></em><br />
<em><strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JUrfrCfvZDc">True Trans Soul Rebel?</a></strong></em></p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<hr />
<p>Clocking in at 10k words (the bulk of it in chatlogs), this tale is now my longest article on record. While I haven't personally gone through much of what happens here, it's a story which resonates deeply with me, and is directly experienced by members of the trans community without end. I hope it carries as much meaning for you as it does for me.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tsercele" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2891035); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2891035&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1582843211" alt="Tsercele" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2891035)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tsercele" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2891035); return false;">Tsercele</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kinchtheknifeblade" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1345012); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1345012&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1582843211" alt="kinchtheknifeblade" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1345012)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kinchtheknifeblade" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1345012); return false;">kinchtheknifeblade</a></span> for their feedback!</p>
<p>This is a followup to <span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><a href="/i-didnt-want-to-see-you-die-like-this">i didn't want to see you die this way</a></span>, though no prior knowledge of it should be necessary to read.</p>
<p>Much of this has intentional typos in the astral/dissociative segments and the chatlogs. If you spot a typo which doesn't look intentional, comment or pm me!</p>
<p>More tales to come.</p>

							</div>

								
					
